\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57ebf9aa27784e60\" href=\"?note=57ebf9aa27784e60\" title=\"43-df-tt\">43-df-tt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ac13d054390a6b63\" href=\"?note=ac13d054390a6b63\" title=\"43-df-many-one\">43-df-many-one</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorems 19.4.10 and 19.4.11 (C and K conditional cases)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"578,582–583"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"598,602–603"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{K_V},N_Q\">\\(M_{K_V},N_Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"32e75726563f73a8\" href=\"?note=32e75726563f73a8\" title=\"43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs\">43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,U:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(V,U:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalPF}\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalPF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE},\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}},\\le_m,\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\operatorname{CE},\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}},\\le_m,\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"57ebf9aa27784e60\" href=\"?note=57ebf9aa27784e60\" title=\"43-df-tt\">43-df-tt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ac13d054390a6b63\" href=\"?note=ac13d054390a6b63\" title=\"43-df-many-one\">43-df-many-one</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 只取本目录已定义的普通与前缀条件复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists V\\in\\{M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{UniversalPF}(M)\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(M_{K_V})\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}M_{K_V}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists V\\in\\{M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{UniversalPF}(M)\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(M_{K_V})\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}M_{K_V}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists U\\in\\{M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{UniversalPF}(M)\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(M_{K_U})\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\not\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}M_{K_U}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists U\\in\\{M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{UniversalPF}(M)\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(M_{K_U})\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\not\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}M_{K_U}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Q\\in\\{C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(N_Q)\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_mN_Q\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Q\\in\\{C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(N_Q)\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_mN_Q\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前两个结论保留通用机器的存在量词，不能把其中任一项推广到所有通用机器。条件上图结论仅写本目录已定义的 C、K；原书还提及 Km，未为覆盖数量另造尚无基础的单调复杂度接口。Muchnik 的有限图游戏长证明仅作原书陈述依据，未登记为完整核验。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorems 19.4.10 and 19.4.11 (C and K conditional cases)，印刷页 578,582–583，PDF 页 598,602–603。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs","status":"resolved","id":"32e75726563f73a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tt","status":"resolved","id":"57ebf9aa27784e60","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-tt]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"ac13d054390a6b63","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-many-one]]","embe